    "body": "Already done in commits `7c46c4d4c` and `207596999`, merged to `main` by PR #2367 (merge commit `ea97d63b4`).\n\n- `7c46c4d4c`: the two heavy motion tests have the depth ladder counts of #2004.\n- `207596999`: `the_users_bore_roughs_adaptive_level_by_level_and_verifies_clean` has the new Windows and Linux readings.\n\nCut gate run 44148337620 is green on that tree. The macOS reading is owed in #2371.\n\nshipped in v0.23.0\n",
